{x - 4} & {2x} & {2x} \cr
{2x} & {x - 4} & {2x} \cr
{2x} & {2x} & {x - 4} \cr

} } \right| = \left( {A + Bx} \right){\left( {x - A} \right)^2}$$

then the ordered pair (A, B) is equal to :

